SUMMARY:Picture Day
DESCRIPTION:Picture day is on Monday\, September 22nd! You may place online orders now at mydorian.com and for up to 4 days after picture day.\n \nFor picture day\, students must wear uniform or nicer attire – please no jeans. All students will get their picture taken as part of their school record\, even if you chose not to order any photos.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/picture-day-7/
CATEGORIES:School Events
END:VEVENT
